<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH KAUCUK CZK 497.0 MLN 9MO PRE-TAX.</title>
<headline>CZECH KAUCUK CZK 497.0 MLN 9MO PRE-TAX.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period</p>
<p>ending September 30, 1996: (in millions of crowns) </p>
<p> Pre-tax	    497.0    vs    1,554</p>
<p> Operating profit	 542.989   vs   1,600.245</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services	   4,516.524   vs  10,558.648</p>
<p> Total assets	  15,488.165   vs  12,620.651</p>
<p> Basic capital	  4,921.290   vs   4,921.290</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Kaucuk Group a.s. . The</p>
<p>company is a chemical concern. Kaucuk divested its oil refinery</p>
<p>operations at the beginning of this year under a government</p>
<p>privatisation plan. Comparative results for Q1-Q3 1995 profit</p>
<p>and sales include refinery operations.</p>
<p>Figures were provided by the company. Kaucuk shares are</p>
<p>traded on the main martket of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
